# An absence is entered during the review: the review is withdrawn and recording starts again.
start
complete RecordHours
complete SubmitTimesheet
complete CheckWorkingTime hasViolations=false
complete RegisterSubmission
complete AnnounceSubmission
trigger AbsenceEntered
expect open ResetAfterAbsence
complete ResetAfterAbsence
complete AnnounceReset
# second round; the deadline timer runs anew for the new recording
expect open RecordHours, SubmissionDeadline
complete RecordHours
complete SubmitTimesheet
complete CheckWorkingTime hasViolations=false
complete RegisterSubmission
complete AnnounceSubmission
complete Review correct=true
complete Release
expect status COMPLETED
history
